Aging WIP — Table layout, filter `-status:Done,Triage`, then View → Sort → Committed ascending. Oldest in-flight item sits on top; walk this at standup. Commitments — Roadmap layout, filter `class-of-service:"Fixed Date"`, date fields Committed → Target Date. Triage — Table layout, filter `status:Triage`, View → Group by → Work Item Type. "Group by" only exists in table and roadmap layouts; in a board it's Column field.
